Package: synos-swap-config
Version: 2.0.2-1+synos1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Maintainer: ${BRAND_VENDOR} <${BRAND_URL_SUPPORT}>
Depends: util-linux
Provides: synos-zram-config
Conflicts: synos-zram-config
Replaces: synos-zram-config
Homepage: ${BRAND_URL_HOME}
Description: ${BRAND_NAME} Swap default configuration — enables 50%-of-RAM lz4 zram and swappiness=100 on boot. Zswap support is installed but remains opt-in via the GUI. Services are installed to /usr/lib/systemd/system/ so synos-swapcontrol-gtk controls them via declarative config files without dpkg conflicts.
